MindIE Agent Domain Knowledge Repository Dual License (CC BY 4.0 & MIT)
=======================================================================

This repository uses a dual-license structure aligned with the
`mindie-publication-contract/2` layout:

1. Knowledge Corpus, Derived Indexes, Public Feedback & Documentation
   - Graded knowledge units (`<domain_path>/unit-*.md`)
   - Derived routing indexes (`index/routing-manifest.json`, `index/shard-topology.json`)
   - Public feedback records (`feedback/`)
   - Documentation and provenance evidence (`README.md`, `README.en.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `docs/`)
   are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
   License (CC BY 4.0).

2. Repository Maintenance Scripts & Workflow Configuration
   - Maintenance utilities (`scripts/`)
   - CI workflows (`.github/workflows/`)
   - Publication contract configuration (`publication-contract.json`)
   are licensed under the MIT License.


